7
00:00:09,780 --> 00:00:11,000
You'd stretch long and thin.

8
00:00:11,500 --> 00:00:12,547
Scientists really call it

9
00:00:12,547 --> 00:00:13,300
spaghettification.

10
00:00:13,960 --> 00:00:16,060
But a supermassive black hole, about 4

11
00:00:16,060 --> 00:00:17,828
million times the Sun's mass, is

12
00:00:17,828 --> 00:00:18,380
different.

13
00:00:18,720 --> 00:00:20,284
The stretch at its edge is so gentle,

14
00:00:20,284 --> 00:00:22,060
